DF/v\u002BH7hEWQOvtOUdJw9Jl4rSrlku6GuY16DDI5Xy3\u002BnXmXaeqlye2goa4tgmMlVXVxxmLhh40n/hZ9DFXEvW\u002B/2ICiQPXvqchoQzCry12KqqcLRrZkXa4Z0wWRj9tuKKrCfK1JyBgcYRMdokIFYaqzfRdhEeiP/vGF6b9urUnuOBz/9HY5TbUPAfzu02Gv77kt9y\u002Bqbisoo4KUIi/7O00ugXK7nZXszixsp8LUcbF5YMf3suf1\u002BduCnC68FnY1\u002BjaP9G6qF6s2vX8wzb4\u002BVqCiEX1N/DgcsVSeHx5BIlIi7xkTvE8Om976bPtJ1ke0h5WbTQY\u002BCrWt8ICp2apxPrIvbefSQJ\u002BPQSlziDjI62Iv4tw7CAn4kMIZy05BrFcsCYoh/1Mv2F8G0p\u002B3tEiSQPuorfeRpVHbsrhmjaU6yqf6s5FBRK83wFRISHY0iUT0DmRvMb42MuLcI/7yoYAQ=="},{"$type":"text","text":"Here is the whole program. It starts the coding agent in the terminal, and the call at the bottom does the work.\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060csharp\nusing LouisAgent.Core.Web;\nusing LouisAgent.Core.Anthropic;\nusing LouisAgent.Core.Ollama;\nusing LouisAgent.Core.OpenAi;\nusing LouisAgent.Core.Telemetry;\nusing LouisAgent.Core.Hosting;\nusing LouisAgent.Cli;\nusing LouisAgent.Coding;\n\n// Usage: LouisAgent.CodingCli [prompt]. It loads what this demo\u0027s catalogue names.\nawait CliHost.RunAsync(args, CodingCatalog.Create(), new HostServices(WebAccess.Create, OtlpTelemetry.Instance, Providers: [AnthropicProvider.Instance, OllamaProvider.Instance, OpenAiCompatibleProvider.Instance]));\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\nThe settings go in your config folder, as \u0060NAME=value\u0060 lines. A key is enough to start with Anthropic:\n\n\u0060\u0060\u0060bash\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your-key-here\nLLM_PROFILE=ollama\n\u0060\u0060\u0060\n\n\u0060LLM_PROFILE=ollama\u0060 picks a local model through Ollama instead. Leave it out to use Anthropic.\n\nTwo things make it your own. \u0060CodingCatalog.Create()\u0060 names what the agent loads, so a catalogue of your own takes its place. \u0060CliHost.RunAsync\u0060 runs whatever catalogue you pass it. Give a prompt after the program\u0027s name to get one answer and exit.\n\nsrc/docs/projects/LouisAgent.Cli.md"},{"$type":"functionCall","name":"Offer","arguments":{"question":"Where shall we go next?","choices":[{"label":"Build an identity","why":"Write who your agent is, as markdown.","suggested":true},{"label":"Build a pack","why":"Give your agent a tool of its own."},{"label":"Explain the program","why":"Go through the lines in order."}]},"informationalOnly":false,"callId":"toolu_0156Dq5jbpeimbbWMpZw2Grf"}],"messageId":"msg_011ChStsS38LmW79XPj8vHof"}],"responseId":"msg_011ChStsS38LmW79XPj8vHof","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","createdAt":"2026-11-27T05:39:24.2143042\u002B00:00","finishReason":"tool_calls","usage":{"inputTokenCount":13720,"outputTokenCount":2003,"totalTokenCount":15723,"cachedInputTokenCount":12615,"additionalCounts":{"CacheCreationInputTokens":1103}}}